results.description:
Great air hockey with modern glow style. Move finger and place the puck on the screen.
Control your ball by drag speed. Play air hockey with multiplayer offline on your device!
It's like a ice hockey, but in the glow space world.
Challenge yourself with the computer opponents!

Features:
- air hockey has amazing graphics and colors: game has the neon dark skin;
- a lot of glow powerups;
- 3 game levels: easy, normal and hard;
- 2 players versus mode;
- free app;
- get all achievements!

Play airhockey with friends and have fun!
Enjoy!
